<title>UK: Grain ship has engine problems in English Channel.</title>
<headline>Grain ship has engine problems in English Channel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Romanian-flag bulk carrier Tirgu Frumos has engine problems in the English Channel, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 18,295 dwt bulker has a 15,000 tonne cargo of grain and is en route from Rouen, France, to Casablanca, Morocco.</p>
<p>Communication with the vessel is difficult, Lloyds added.</p>
</text>
